<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 120 bln lvs 4-wk T-bills this week.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 120 bln lvs 4-wk T-bills this week.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer five issues of four-week discount T-bills worth a total of 120 billion levs at auctions this week, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with a maximum par of 24 billion levs each and no minimum acceptable price set in advance.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE    ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3037297002	 June 2	    June 3	  July 1</p>
<p> BG3037397000	 June 3	    June 4	  July 2</p>
<p> BG3037497008	 June 4	    June 5	  July 3</p>
<p> BG3037597005	 June 5	    June 6	  July 4</p>
<p> BG3037697003	 June 6	    June 9	  July 7</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
